MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Prototype_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a86866b46e734848b039b830feb29a0, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 884871168
    m_Localized: "Motel guest ledger \u2014 provisional text"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 947785728
    m_Localized: 'The ledger lies open beside an empty key hook. Most entries list
      an arrival, a room and a departure. One line has no departure at all.


      Room
      12: a guest whose name has been rubbed away. Beside the line, someone has drawn
      a narrow figure in a long coat. Its outline resembles the shape at the far
      end of this corridor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980032
    m_Localized: 'A note in another hand reads: ''Asked to see the radio host. Said
      they had met before the last broadcast. Waited in the corridor after reception
      closed.''


      The host is now missing. This guest may have seen them before
      they disappeared. The ledger does not tell you what happened, or why the guest''s
      name is missing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980033
    m_Localized: 'Under the entry: ''Do not mistake waiting for following.''


      If
      the outline belongs to the figure, switching the receiver on may be silencing
      a witness. You could return with a charged battery, turn the radio off yourself
      and approach. You would still have the option of turning it back on.


      The
      entry remains available here and in your journal after you finish reading.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980034
    m_Localized: "Faded corridor photograph \u2014 provisional text"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980035
    m_Localized: 'A faded photograph shows this same row of motel doors. In the margin,
      someone has written ''before the disappearance''. There is no date you can
      verify.


      A narrow person in a dark coat stands beside room 12. Their
      face is indistinct. On the back, the outline has been traced in pencil, as
      if the shape mattered more than the face.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980036
    m_Localized: 'Behind the person is a notice bearing the radio station''s emblem.
      A corner has been folded over a second person; you cannot identify them.


      This
      is a lead, not proof. Compare the coat and the room with the guest ledger.
      The photograph offers a way to recognize the waiting figure without deciding
      who they are or what became of them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980037
    m_Localized: "The Unaccepted \u2014 fragmented testimony"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980038
    m_Localized: '''You came back.''


      The figure does not close the distance.
      Its voice arrives in pieces, with silence between words.


      ''I thought
      ... you would keep it playing. Most do.''


      It turns toward the empty
      doors. There is no gesture of attack. The charged receiver is still in your
      hand. You can switch it on and leave at any time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980039
    m_Localized: '''The host came here ... before the voice stopped. Asked about
      a room. Not mine. I waited ... where the light ends.''


      You ask whether
      they saw the host leave.


      ''I heard the car. Saw the coat. That is not
      ... the same as seeing a person leave.''


      The account is incomplete.
      It does not establish a death, a culprit or a final chronology.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980040
    m_Localized: '''The station. Start there. They kept ... a paper copy. For when
      the tape ...''


      The rest is lost in the fluorescent hum.


      You
      ask which paper. The figure repeats: ''The programme sheet. Last broadcast.
      Look for ... the part that was changed.''


      This points to something
      you could check independently at the radio station.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980041
    m_Localized: 'For a moment, the shape resembles the coat in the motel photograph.
      Then its edges settle back into shadow.


      ''Please. Do not write ...
      that you know what happened. You heard me. That is all.''


      You have
      a witness account and an investigative lead, not a solved case. The ledger
      and photograph can be revisited. Nothing requires you to surrender the receiver
      or lose your notes.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980042
    m_Localized: 'NEW LEAD: Visit the radio station and locate the programme sheet
      for the host''s last broadcast. Compare it with the witness''s account before
      drawing a conclusion.


      Finish this page to add the fragmented testimony
      to your evidence journal. The radio station itself is outside this prototype.


      End
      of The First Witness encounter. You may continue exploring and reopen all collected
      evidence with Tab.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980043
    m_Localized: THE FIRST WITNESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980044
    m_Localized: No evidence collected yet. Inspect the motel ledger and photograph
      with E. Finish reading to keep an entry here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980045
    m_Localized: Explore the corridor. Try silence near the far doors; Left Shift
      controls the receiver. E inspects objects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980046
    m_Localized: A figure waits in silence. Try turning the radio on. The motel ledger
      may explain who waited here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980047
    m_Localized: The signal hides the figure. Inspect the cream-colored guest ledger
      near reception (left of the test marker).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980048
    m_Localized: The guest may be a witness. Keep charge available, switch ON then
      voluntarily OFF, and return to the far corridor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980049
    m_Localized: You chose silence. Approach the figure at the far doors; Left Shift
      remains your way out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980050
    m_Localized: 'NEW LEAD: the radio station''s programme sheet. Testimony is in
      your journal (Tab). Encounter complete; station level is not built yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980051
    m_Localized: "89.4 \u2014 Motel prototype\nRADIO {0}  |  BATTERY {1}%\nA/D: walk  
      Left Shift: radio   E: interact   F1: language"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980052
    m_Localized: ON / STABLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980053
    m_Localized: OFF / DRIFT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980054
    m_Localized: "Journal \u2014 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980055
    m_Localized: Evidence journal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980056
    m_Localized: '{0} entries   {1}/{2}   A: back   D: next   Tab/Esc: close'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980057
    m_Localized: '{0}/{1}   A: back   D: next/finish   Esc: close'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980058
    m_Localized: '{0}  |  Tab: journal

      {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980059
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 replace battery (unlimited prototype supply)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980060
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980061
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect test marker"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980062
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect motel guest ledger"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980063
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect faded corridor photograph"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980064
    m_Localized: Language settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980065
    m_Localized: "[1] English\n[2] \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0439"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980066
    m_Localized: 'Selected: {0}

      F1: close'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980067
    m_Localized: English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 951980068
    m_Localized: "\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0439"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964095021056
    m_Localized: Current registration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907136
    m_Localized: 'CLERK: "The bureau booked one night?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907137
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "One for now."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907138
    m_Localized: 'CLERK: "Sign here. If you need another, tell me before noon."


      [You
      sign the current registration line. A room key is provided.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907139
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Can I visit the radio station tonight?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907140
    m_Localized: 'CLERK: "Try in the morning. I wouldn''t count on anyone answering
      the door now."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907141
    m_Localized: "MOTEL \u2014 Reception"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907142
    m_Localized: "MOTEL \u2014 Your guest room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907143
    m_Localized: "MOTEL \u2014 Guest corridor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907144
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 TEST: replace battery (does not turn radio ON)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907145
    m_Localized: ON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907146
    m_Localized: OFF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907147
    m_Localized: '[Movement in the corridor.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907148
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Someone''s still up."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907149
    m_Localized: A man in the corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907150
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Do you work here?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907151
    m_Localized: 'MAN: "Nights."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907152
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''m here about the missing presenter from the local
      station."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907153
    m_Localized: 'MAN: "Their program''s on now."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907154
    m_Localized: Your portable receiver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964178907155
    m_Localized: Your receiver is OFF beside your belongings. E at the receiver takes
      it; inspecting the bag does not. You can go into the corridor without it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101440
    m_Localized: '[You take the receiver. It remains OFF.]

      Left Shift controls
      power once carried. E at your bag reviews its program while ON.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101441
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Let''s hear which program he means."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101442
    m_Localized: Left Shift turns your carried receiver ON. Then use E at the bag
      to review the program. The cyan test stand replaces an empty battery without
      switching ON.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101443
    m_Localized: 'ANNOUNCER: "Good evening. A reminder that tomorrow''s community
      notices must reach the station before midday. We''ll be back after the music."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101444
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''ll ask him what he meant."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101445
    m_Localized: The corridor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101446
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "Gone."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101447
    m_Localized: 'JOURNALIST: "I''ll ask at the desk in the morning."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101448
    m_Localized: 'PROTOTYPE: First-night trial complete. Morning inquiry is not included
      yet.

      This is a development notice, not dialogue. Esc closes; D finishes.
      You may look around and return to the room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101449
    m_Localized: Current registration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101450
    m_Localized: Finish the current check-in before using your room. This grants
      no access to historical guest records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101451
    m_Localized: Check in at the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101452
    m_Localized: Find your room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101453
    m_Localized: See who's in the corridor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101454
    m_Localized: Speak to the man, if someone is there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101455
    m_Localized: Fetch your receiver from the room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101456
    m_Localized: Check the station on your receiver.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101457
    m_Localized: Ask the man about the program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101458
    m_Localized: First-night trial complete. You may return to the room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101459
    m_Localized: left with belongings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101460
    m_Localized: carried
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101461
    m_Localized: 'A/D: walk   E: interact   Receiver: {0}, {1} ({2}%)

      Left
      Shift: power when carried   Reading: A/D, Esc close   F1: language'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101462
    m_Localized: "WORKING v02 \u2014 text-only program/movement. No new art/audio
      integration."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101463
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 current registration / clerk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101464
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 enter your room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101465
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 take the receiver"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101466
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 inspect bag / review your receiver"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101467
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 go into the corridor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101468
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 return to your room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101469
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 speak to the man"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 440964183101470
    m_Localized: "E \u2014 look around the empty corridor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
